{aligned}f(x) & =\\frac{x+2}{{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-4x+4} \\\\  & =\\frac{x+2}{{x}^{2}(x-1)-4(x-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{x+2}{({x}^{2}-4)(x-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{x+2}{(x-2)(x+2)(x-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{x+2}}{(x-2)\\cancel{(x+2)}(x-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(x-2)(x-1)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we set the denominator equal to zero and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n(x-2)(x-1)=0\n$$\n\nThis gives the solutions $x=1$ and $x=2.$ \n\nTherefore, in ascending order, the equations of the vertical asymptotes are $x=1$ and $x=2.$" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244459 13194139533655 true] [17592186244458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244460 13194139533655 true] [17592186244458 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533655 true] [17592186244458 1041 "field-1" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244458 1104 #edb/ref 17592186244459 13194139533655 true] [17592186244458 1110 #uuid "e7481fd3-ff5f-51be-999e-837b4dcbeefe" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244459 1034 "1" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244459 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533655 true] [17592186244459 1111 #uuid "b97cc287-7d92-5b2f-86e3-a1dd8cb4b12c" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244460 1034 "-2" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244460 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533655 true] [17592186244460 1111 #uuid "4cd1a1d2-f7c4-568b-a2a1-2c56085af28f" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244461 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244462 13194139533655 true] [17592186244461 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533655 true] [17592186244461 1041 "field-2" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244461 1104 #edb/ref 17592186244462 13194139533655 true] [17592186244461 1110 #uuid "17876d32-327c-5ed4-89d8-85a2e4d81fb3" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244462 1034 "2" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244462 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533655 true] [17592186244462 1111 #uuid "e336a1f1-a8a2-5693-a6b1-a00bc815cd9d" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244463 1017 #edb/ref 17592186244464 13194139533655 true] [17592186244463 1089 "q-278556" 13194139533655 true] [17592186244